{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1342535-is-there-a-way-to-create-hulk","id":1342535,"title":"Is there a way to create Hulk?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-20T08:29:55-07:00","id":1342535,"title":"Is there a way to create Hulk?","content":"I mean, I considered simply tying dormancy to multiple personality disorder, but that really isn't good enough. Is there a way to have stats shift from mega strength and stamina in one personality, to mega intelligence in the other?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T09:30:29-07:00","id":1342544,"title":"","content":"Possibly a combination of Boost with the Extra Attribute and Variable Attribute tags. Of course if Bruce Banner has Might 2 and the Hulk has Might 5, Mega-Might 5, that means he'd need Quantum 8 in order to buy Boost 8. That'd also push his Intellect absurdly high since he presumably starts with Intellect 4 or 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T09:31:41-07:00","id":1342545,"title":"","content":"Hulk doesn\u2019t need to be stupid at all, he just need to be enraged all the time. From Aexpansion, page 77:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Enraged! Enraged characters suffer a +2 Complication to all actions that rely on patience, thought, or empathy. The one who enraged them gains a +2 Enhancement to influence them.<br /> Resolution: The Condition wears off at the end of the scene. Alternatively, Enraged characters can spend 4 successes to remove the Condition when they try to act against their anger. </div> </div> </div>You can make it even worse, Hulk is permanently Enraged and get a increase in the penalty whenever use Boost. He is always Mega Intelligent, but can\u2019t keep the concentration while transformed in hulk.<br /> <br /> Of course you need to have a Transformation power limited to a single form, that turn you into the Hulk and nothing else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","